---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Airport Terminal Ceiling Access — ARCLIFT"
  description="Zero-emission electric crawler platforms for airport terminal ceiling maintenance, lighting upgrades, and HVAC access."
  transparentNav={false}
>

  <section class="hero-banner">
    <div class="overline">Airport Terminal</div>
    <h1>AIRPORT CEILING MAINTENANCE</h1>
    <p>Ceiling panel installation and maintenance, lighting system upgrades, HVAC access. Zero-emission indoor operation.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sec">
    <div style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:20px;">Why Airports Choose ARCLIFT</h2>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:#475569;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">Airport terminals combine some of the toughest ceiling access conditions: high clearances (20m–35m), security-restricted zones, continuous passenger flow below, and strict noise/emission limits. Traditional access methods either block gates or cannot handle the long ceiling spans.</p>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:#475569;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">FDDPT platforms operate in electric mode with zero emissions and near-silent operation. The crawler tracks distribute weight gently across terminal flooring — no outrigger point loads. One machine covers the ceiling area that would require 8–10 spider lift repositions, without ever moving barricades at floor level.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sec sec--gray">
    <div class="sec__header reveal">
      <div class="sec__overline">Recommended Models</div>
      <h2 class="sec__title">FOR AIRPORT TERMINALS</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">FDDPT-25M — Mid-Range</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;">Ideal for most terminal ceiling heights (15m–25m). Good balance of platform size and turning radius for navigating between gate areas and check-in halls.</p>
        <a href="/products/fddpt-25m-crawler-ceiling-platform/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">View Model →</a>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:32px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;">
        <h3 style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">FDDPT-31M — High-Reach</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px;">For taller international terminal atriums (25m+). Electric mode standard. Large platform for multi-crew lighting and mechanical upgrades.</p>
        <a href="/products/fddpt-31m-crawler-ceiling-platform/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">View Model →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <h2>AIRPORT CEILING PROJECT ON THE HORIZON?</h2>
    <p>We'll help you specify the right model for your terminal height and access restrictions.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn--white">Request a Specification →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
